&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal communication skills, with the ability to handle complex interactions professionally and empathetically.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in using CRM and other customer support tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills, with the ability to think quickly and provide effective solutions to customer issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team player who is adaptable and agile, capable of working in a dynamic, remote environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Alignment with Faire&#39;s core values and a genuine passion for supporting and serving our community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
